Boost.Call_stack: a collection of call stack utilities built around http://www.boost.org. 
[N3441 implementation](https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2012/n3441.html).

Disclaimer: this is not part of the boost libraries collection.

Code repository:  https://github.com/melintea/Boost-Call_stack 
Documentation:    http://melintea.github.io/Boost-Call_stack/index.html.

